FRO7: [BRIEF] The system will allow students to request a specific staff member if they are available

FRO8: [BRIEF] The system will notify both the student and staff member on event of a successful booking.

FRO9: [CANDIDATE] The system will allow students to reschedule or cancel appointments up until a certain timeframe before the appointment (decided by the college)

