FRO11: [BRIEF] The system shall manage staff availability.
 
FRO12: [BRIEF] The system will send a reminder to both students and support staff prior to the appointment.

FRO13: [CANDIDATE] The system will enable the booked staff member to record if a student attends or doesn't attend

FRO14: [BRIEF] The system will allow support staff to block off specific times, days or weeks.

FRO15: [CANDIDATE] The system will require all users to authenticate based on the colleges sign-in system.

FRO16: [CANDIDATE] The system should allow students to view previous and upcoming appointments.

